via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/33566924","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2722#issuecomment-33566924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2722","id":33566924,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMzNTY2OTI0","user":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-01-29T09:05:11Z","updated_at":"2014-01-29T09:05:11Z","body":"@Grafikart There were a couple major reasons for the change. the biggest one is that this time we decided to skip identifier quoting by default, since that was the main performance bottleneck in the 2.x ORM. Unfortunately, messing with the table aliases (like table plural -> singular alias) was causing SQL errors as sometimes the inflections would hit a reserved SQL keyword, for example `orders -> order` and `users -> user`.\n\nThe second major reason is that we now have 2 separate ideas. One is `Table`, which represent the collection of rows and the other is the `Entity`. Having a collection of something being forced to singular was extremely unnatural and represented more things to remember for the developer.\n\nIn conclusion, we just relaxed the convention. You can now name your tables however you please and the class name will naturally follow by convention.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/33566924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":89317324,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50ODkzMTczMjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/events/89317324","actor":{"login":"Grafikart","id":395137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grafikart","html_url":"https://github.com/Grafikart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grafikart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grafikart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grafikart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_